('52', 'abrasive-coated textile material (heading 6805) and also carbon fibres or articles of carbon fibres of heading 6815', ARRAY['68']::text[], '6805', 'Section XI Note 1(q)', 'This section does not cover: a. animal brush-making bristles or hair (heading 0502); horsehair or horsehair waste (heading 0511); b. human hair or articles of human hair (heading 0501, 6703 or 6704), except filtering or straining cloth of a kind commonly used in oil-presses or the like (heading 5911); c. cotton linters or other vegetable materials of Chapter 14; d. asbestos of heading 2524 or articles of asbestos or other products of heading 6812 or 6813; e. articles of heading 3005 or 3006; ...')
